{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "aptech-tbx-api-v1",
    "name": "AP-Tech (TBX) Banking & Card Platform API (Internal Full)",
    "description": "Enterprise API documentation for the AP-Tech Digital Prepaid Card, Single Sign-On (SSO), and Hubble Money Rewards & Voucher Marketplace platform.\n\n### Key Features\n- **Authentication & SSO:** Aptech ProConnect OAuth2/SSO authorization code exchange (`/auth/sso/exchange`), session renewal (`/auth/refresh`), profile verification (`/auth/me`), and logout (`/auth/logout`).\n- **Card Issuance & Banking:** TransBnk (TrustHub) RuPay Virtual GPR prepaid card issuance, Min KYC, Aadhaar e-KYC/PAN Full KYC, fund loading (APIs 1–7), and PCI-DSS CardSDK session management.\n- **Hubble Rewards & Vouchers:** Live Aptech Coin Ledger balance querying, atomic voucher debits, two-phase rollbacks, and AES-256 encrypted webhook delivery.\n\n### Authentication\n- **Student / Client Endpoints:** Require `Authorization: Bearer <accessToken>` or the HTTP-only `accessToken` cookie.\n- **Hubble Cloud Callbacks:** Require the `X-Hubble-Secret` header.\n- **Financial Operations:** Support `Idempotency-Key` headers.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
